    <bpmn:process id="W_W2635" name="W2635. Bulk Material Handling at Job Site" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Delivery of bulk construction materials
Frequency: Ad-hoc; ~50–80 bulk deliveries/month
Volume: ~50–80/month
Owner: Logistics Coordinator
Participants: Logistics Coord, Driver, Contractor, 3PL Dump Truck Partner
Source: workflow W2635 — Bulk Material Handling at Job Site</bpmn:documentation>
